{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26092","headline":"闻国家将行封禅聊抒臣情 · 鲍溶","name":"闻国家将行封禅聊抒臣情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云雨由来随六龙，玉泥瑶检不乾封。\n山知槱柞新烟火，臣望箫韶旧鼓钟。\n清跸间过素王庙，翠华高映大夫松。\n旅中病客谙尧曲，身贱何由奏九重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}